# Client photographs are NOT redistributed.
# The starter README says "please use it just for this challenge and don't
# redistribute it", so the images are deliberately not committed. Drop them
# into data/images/ to run. Ground-truth labels are keyed by the original
# filenames, so no renaming is needed.
data/images/*.jpg
data/images/*.jpeg
data/images/*.png
data/images/*.webp
